<title>CHINA: China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) mixed.</title>
<headline>China interbank market rates (CHIBOR) mixed.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the China Interbank Offered Rate (CHIBOR) for Tuesday issued by the official Xinhua news agency on behalf of the People's Bank of China, the central bank.</p>
<p>The figures represent weighted averages and not closing prices and are annual percentage rates.</p>
<p>		 1DAY   7DAY  20DAY  30DAY  60DAY  90DAY  120DAY</p>
<p> TUESDAY    11.510 11.612 11.574 11.748 11.602 11.790 12.074</p>
<p> MONDAY     10.866 10.986 11.567 11.547 11.621 11.965 12.153</p>
<p>Turnover plunged to 979 million yuan from 2.798 billion yuan on Monday with the 90-day contract the most active.</p>
</text>
